-8c_{1110}c_{1011}c_{0120}c_{0102}^2+16c_{2001}c_{0120}^2c_{0102}^2 \\ +16c_{1002}^2c_{0210}^2c_{0021}+
8c_{1011}c_{1002}c_{0210}c_{0201}c_{0021}-4c_{1011}^2c_{0201}^2c_{0021}-16c_{1020}c_{1002}c_{0201}^2c_{0021} 
