+    "i,j.  Hence product_k(I+d0(k)N0+d1(k)N1) is I+(sum d0)N0+(sum d1)N1. "
+    "Each d_j(k)=h_j(s_{k+1})-h_j(s_k), so the sums are endpoint differences. "
