The revised bare run is evaluating `easy` with a 61-bit modulus. Local checks still pass, the shipping answer remains 25 atoms/under 200 tokens, and the intended route is unchanged at 237 operations; only the exact arithmetic entropy has increased.
diff --git a/gen_1801_05377.py b/gen_1801_05377.py
