+L*M_0*M_1*...*M_(n-1).  The resulting target cubic has the following 20
+coefficients.  A line e0,e1,e2,e3: c means coefficient c on
+x0^e0*x1^e1*x2^e2*x3^e3.
+
+{chr(10).join(coefficient_lines)}
