+with exactly the keys \"weight\" and \"form\".
+Example: <answer>[{{\"weight\":2,\"form\":[1,0,1,-1]}},{{\"weight\":3,\"form\":[1,1,0,0]}},{{\"weight\":5,\"form\":[1,-1,1,0]}},{{\"weight\":7,\"form\":[1,0,-1,1]}},{{\"weight\":11,\"form\":[1,1,1,1]}}]</answer>
